 800-207 §3.3 · CISA Zero Trust Maturity Model.""}, ""max_subordinates"": null, ""required_certifications"": [""SBOS_OPERATOR_CERT"", ""ISO27001_AWARENESS""]}",019f8c34-9c99-7379-a1c1-278de324cdbb,2026-07-09 06:17:23.715117+00,2026-07-09 23:13:30.010643+00,,6b377435-a543-469f-a33f-cfc193f1759a,HIGH,INTERNAL,"{""en"": ""Technical infrastructure role with access to ecosystem systems and platforms. Subject to quarterly review and privileged access management (PAM) per NIST AC-5."", ""es"": ""Rol técnico de infraestructura con acceso a sistemas y plataformas del ecosistema. Sujeto a revisión trimestral y gestión de acceso privilegiado (PAM) conforme a NIST AC-5.""}",,2026-07-24 00:00:00+00,2026-10-22 02:02:08.660551+00,t,,,0,"{""algorithm"": ""EdDSA_Ed25519"", ""signature"": null, ""signed_at"": null, ""signed_by"": null, ""certificate_id"": null, ""post_quantum_planned"": true}",2026-07-24 21:30:21.759788+00,BOOTSTRAP,,,,,INDEFINITE,2026-07-24,,,,0
